.SH "NAME"
Koha::HoldGroup \- Koha Hold Group object class
.SH "API"
.IX Header "API"
.SS "Class Methods"
.IX Subsection "Class Methods"
\fIstore\fR
.IX Subsection "store"
.PP
.Vb 1
\&    store override
.Ve
.PP
Logs changes to related holds
.PP
\fIdelete\fR
.IX Subsection "delete"
.PP
.Vb 1
\&    delete override
.Ve
.PP
Log changes to related holds
.PP
\fIto_api\fR
.IX Subsection "to_api"
.PP
.Vb 1
\&    my $json = $hold_group\->to_api;
.Ve
.PP
Overloaded method that returns a \s-1JSON\s0 representation of the Koha::HoldGroup object,
suitable for \s-1API\s0 output. The related Koha::Holds objects are merged as expected
on the \s-1API.\s0
.PP
\fIholds\fR
.IX Subsection "holds"
.PP
.Vb 1
\&    $holds = $hold_group\->holds
.Ve
.PP
Return all holds associated with this group
.PP
\fIold_holds\fR
.IX Subsection "old_holds"
.PP
.Vb 1
\&    $holds = $hold_group\->old_holds
.Ve
.PP
Return all old holds associated with this group
.PP
\fItarget_hold_id\fR
.IX Subsection "target_hold_id"
.PP
.Vb 1
\&    $holds = $hold_group\->target_hold_id
.Ve
.PP
Return the target_hold_id
.PP
\fIskip_non_target_holds_query\fR
.IX Subsection "skip_non_target_holds_query"
.PP
.Vb 1
\&    $where{\*(Aqme.hold_group_id\*(Aq} = Koha::HoldGroup::skip_non_target_holds_query(\*(Aqdbix\*(Aq)
.Ve
.PP
Static method, returns the query part be added if DisplayAddHoldGroups
Accepts a \f(CW$query_type\fR of 'dbix' or 'sql' and returns the respective query
The query is designed to skip non target holds that are part of a hold group which already has a hold target
.PP
